                    <div class="space-y-1">
                        <label class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-semibold">Bán kính quét định vị GPS:</label>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-body-sm">
                            <span>Khoảng cách: <strong>15 km</strong></span>
                            <span class="text-tertiary font-bold">48 Tình nguyện viên O Rh(-)</span>
                        </div>
                        <input class="w-full accent-primary h-2 bg-surface-container rounded-lg cursor-pointer" max="50" min="5" type="range" value="15">
